  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sphc 102.04 \"Board\" means \"board\" as defined in RSA 326-F:1, III, namely, \"the governing board of speech-language pathologists and hearing care providers established in RSA 328-F.\"\n\nSource. #14193, eff 2-12-25",
